        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f3fb3a0-990f-42c5-b28b-63ac6390ab46).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome back to Hokkaido 47. We have three targets, who are still keeping the virus safe. The names of the targets are Ellinor Yasuda, Michael Brennan, and Andrew Roovers. You too of course have to destroy the virus so: There is a container downstairs. You need a certain outfit to get inside. Then press &quot;Ruin stem cells&quot; For this you need any poison. After that you will get a sample which you have to bring to me or you can even assassinate one of the targets with it. Good luck 47.  Have fun!",
